Source: sonic-ycabled-rs
Maintainer: SONiC Team <sonic-dev@lists.sonicfoundation.dev>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), protobuf-compiler, python3-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0

Package: sonic-ycabled-rs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: SONiC Y-cable daemon in Rust
 ycabled-rs serves the same tables as the Python ycabled of
 sonic-platform-daemons, with the same fields and values, so that
 orchagent, linkmgrd, xcvrd and the muxcable CLI work with either. pmon
 runs one or the other, as use_rust_ycabled in pmon_daemon_control.json
 selects.
